background:rgb(255,244,229);mso-shading:rgb(255,244,229);" >* L&#432;u &#253; c&#7921;c k&#7923; quan tr&#7885;ng v&#7873; GPIO35 v&#224; GPIO36:</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,244,229);
mso-shading:rgb(255,244,229);" >&nbsp;Tr&#234;n d&#242;ng chip ESP32-S3 N16R8, hai ch&#226;n n&#224;y c&#243; th&#7875; n&#7889;i n&#7897;i b&#7897; v&#7899;i b&#7897; nh&#7899; Octal PSRAM. Khi l&#7853;p tr&#236;nh tr&#234;n Arduino IDE, b&#7841;n </span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;
background:rgb(255,244,229);mso-shading:rgb(255,244,229);" >b&#7855;t bu&#7897;c ph&#7843;i v&#224;o Tools -&gt; PSRAM -&gt; Ch&#7885;n Disabled (T&#7855;t PSRAM)</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,244,229);
mso-shading:rgb(255,244,229);" >&nbsp;&#273;&#7875; gi&#7843;i ph&#243;ng ho&#224;n to&#224;n 2 ch&#226;n n&#224;y &#273;i&#7873;u khi&#7875;n &#272;&#7897;ng c&#417; 2 m&#224; kh&#244;ng b&#7883; treo chip! </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(0,89,179);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1.2. B&#7843;ng k&#7871;t n&#7889;i Driver TB6612 #1 (C&#7847;u Tr&#432;&#7899;c M1, M2) v&#224; TB6612 #2 (C&#7847;u Sau M3, M4)</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(0,89,179);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Ngu&#7891;n nu&#244;i &#273;&#7897;ng c&#417;:</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;Ch&#226;n </span><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:Consolas;
font-size:12.0000pt;background:rgb(240,240,240);mso-shading:rgb(240,240,240);" >VM</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;c&#7911;a c&#7843; 2 chip TB6612 &#273;&#432;&#7907;c n&#7889;i v&#224;o ngu&#7891;n </span><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >6V</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;(ng&#245; ra Buck 2). &#272;i&#7873;u n&#224;y gi&#250;p b&#7843;o v&#7879; an to&#224;n tuy&#7879;t &#273;&#7889;i cho 4 &#273;&#7897;ng c&#417; 3-6V c&#7911;a b&#7841;n, kh&#244;ng lo b&#7883; ch&#225;y khi ch&#7841;y l&#226;u!</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;"><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(0,89,179);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;">1.3. [MỚI BỔ SUNG] Bảng kết nối Cảm biến Góc Từ 360° AS5600 (Header P2 - 4 Chân 2.54mm)</span></b></h3>
<p class=p style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;"><b>Vị trí đặt trên Schematic &amp; PCB (Altium Designer):</b> Thêm 01 linh kiện <b>Header 4-Pin (2.54mm)</b> đặt tên là <b>P2 (AS5600)</b> ngay ở cạnh trên bo mạch (sát bên cạnh Header <b>P1 - YDLidar X2</b> và đầu trên của <b>PCA9685 - U1</b>) để đi dây bus I2C ngắn nhất:</span></p>
<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100.0000%;border:1.0000pt solid rgb(77,77,77);">
<tr>
<td style="padding:5pt;background:rgb(230,242,255);font-weight:bold;">Chân Header P2 (PCB)</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;background:rgb(230,242,255);font-weight:bold;">Chân trên Module AS5600</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;background:rgb(230,242,255);font-weight:bold;">Tên Net trên Schematic</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;background:rgb(230,242,255);font-weight:bold;">Kết nối về ESP32-S3 / PCA9685</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;background:rgb(230,242,255);font-weight:bold;">Điện áp &amp; Quy tắc đi dây PCB</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>Pin 1</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>VCC</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>M1.1 (3V3)</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;">Chân <b>3V3 (J1_1 / J1_2)</b> của ESP32-S3</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;">Nguồn 3.3V DC chuẩn logic I2C (Độ rộng dây: 0.5mm)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>Pin 2</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>GND + DIR</b> (Hàn nối tắt DIR vào GND trên bo AS5600)</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>GND_Logic</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;">Mass chung hệ thống logic (GND)</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;">0V (Phủ đồng Polygon Pour GND_Logic trực tiếp)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>Pin 3</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>SCL</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>SV1.1</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;">Nối chung <b>GPIO10 (J1_16)</b> &amp; chân SCL_1 của PCA9685</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;">Xung nhịp I2C 400kHz (Độ rộng dây: 0.3mm - 0.4mm)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>Pin 4</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>SDA</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;"><b>SV1.2</b></td>
<td style="padding:5pt;">Nối chung <b>GPIO6 (J1_6)</b> &amp; chân SDA_1 của PCA9685</td>
<td style="padding:5pt;">Dữ liệu I2C (Địa chỉ AS5600 = 0x36, PCA9685 = 0x40)</td>
</tr>
</table>
